mented into existing game lines. I don't want to have to struggle through converting older books, because the Trinity Continuum corebook and a handful of other products have been released using the Ultra ruleset. That is something I am already having to do in the Chronicles of Darkness.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9255-docsteve2020","name":"DocSteve2020","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"25"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-10T06:49:32-07:00","id":1489630,"title":"","content":"Major changes in Terminology <br /> Was Scale ( X Number) =&gt; Now Advantage ( X Number)<br /> Was 'You need X Successes to spend...' =&gt; Now 'You need X Hits to spend...'<br /> Stunts becomes Tricks","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 08-10-2022, 10:13 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-10T10:16:27-07:00","id":1489648,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>DocSteve2020</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1489621-storypath-ultra-in-trinity-continuum?p=1489628#post1489628\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It leaves me a bit nervous, to be honest. As much as the idea of a common Storypath system is appealing in order to pull in material from Scion or They Came From, they need to be careful about how it's implemented into existing game lines. I don't want to have to struggle through converting older books, because the Trinity Continuum corebook and a handful of other products have been released using the Ultra ruleset. That is something I am already having to do in the Chronicles of Darkness.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>In the panel they said that at this time they don't plan on new books for existing game lines to use Ultra, unless the line has very discreet books (They Came From... being a good example since each book is self contained and contains the core rules). So the current plan isn't to have new books for TC use Ultra, from what I understood.<br /> <br /> They have some ideas about doing a conversion guide, they don't want to go through each Gift and power and rewrite it, but more provide guidance on how to covert different systems to Ultra if you want to. It sounded like the conversion guide is very much something they're thinking about, but haven't started on or anything, so the final form, if any, may be different.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4270-literatzi","name":"literatzi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4270_2.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"177"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-10T10:24:16-07:00","id":1489650,"title":"","content":"Correct, none of the TC games in the near future will be using Storypath Ultra. Accordingly, locking the thread.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#800000\">Ian A. A. Watson</span></b><span style=\"color:#bdc3c7\">(he/she)</span><br /> <b>Onyx Path Community Manager<br /> Trinity Continuum Content Lead</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4-ianwatson","name":"IanWatson","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4_2.png","title":"Community Manager","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1512"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}